{
    if (!nextLexicographic(m_curElement, m_meshStart, m_meshEnd))
        nextLeaf();
}
```

The comment `// went through all elements in m_leaf` also contradicts the `if (isGood)` condition it is attached to. That suggests the condition was flipped by accident rather than on purpose.

